  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">4th Congress of Reconciliationin Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia has been suffering from a 40-year internal conflict which has caused mass displacement and human rights abuses. The Colombian Church is at the forefront of efforts for peace and reconciliation. Since 2000 the Social Department of the Bishops Conference (SNPS) / Caritas Colombia has organised three Congresses of Reconciliationin order to raise awareness amongst civil society, faith based organisations, academics, diplomatic circles and Caritas Internationalis. The fourth Congress will focus on human and social development as a means to achieving peace and reconciliation.</narrative>
  </description>
